{"id":"vod_bf_23936","vodId":"23936","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"魔术快斗","name_cn":"魔术快斗","date":"2010-01-01","year":"2010","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"完结","images":{"common":"https://p.bfvp26.com/upload/vod/20230424-25/5a89233f9b89c8aa2d7d7710d2a68040.jpg"},"summary":"白色斗篷、高礼帽，单片夹鼻眼镜。出现在午夜的高楼，留下拿走宝石的通知函。这是我们熟知的怪盗基德。在《名侦探柯南》里，他是不亚于工藤新一和江户川柯南的明星人物。而他的真实身份则是高中生黑羽快斗（山口胜平 配音），为了调查父亲的失踪事件，扮起了父亲之前扮演的角色——怪盗基德，希望引出神秘组织的出现，进而调查出事情的真相。　　《魔术快斗》首次连载在《少年SUNDAY》上是1987年，中途停载了数次，至今仍未完结。号称杂志上连载时间最长的漫画。由于怪盗基德经常性在柯南里客串，以至于很多人都误认为这是柯南的原创人物，其实基德有其正篇漫画，从其诞生时间来看，他比柯南更早出现，漫画里则有很多奇幻因素，而基德的性格也有所不同。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2026-06-10 03:03:23","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/moshukuaidou/第01集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/moshukuaidou/第02集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/moshukuaidou/第03集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/moshukuaidou/第04集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/moshukuaidou/第05集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/moshukuaidou/第06集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/moshukuaidou/第07集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/moshukuaidou/第08集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/moshukuaidou/第09集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/moshukuaidou/第10集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/moshukuaidou/第11集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/moshukuaidou/第12集/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T09:24:19.943Z"}